{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L122","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV5store7consent9enrichers8samplers12samplingSeed3nowACx_AA7ConsentVSgSayAA8EnricherVGSayAA7SamplerVGs6UInt64V20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctc11Persistence11RecordStoreRzlufc","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RecordStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { Date.now })"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"consent","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"enrichers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"samplers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}]}]},{"name":"samplingSeed","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}]}]},{"name":"now","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", rather than a stage reading ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"consent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record is written once its category","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the recovered records from ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything tracked.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"title":"Sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/RecordStore":{"title":"RecordStore","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/recordstore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a tracker keeps each record until it is delivered, so records survive the app ending."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","text":"RecordStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"isActive":tr